Code Summary
  Timer that runs for as long as you hold down the button. 
  Maximum of 9 seconds, holding for >9s; print release button message
  When timer runs down, light show with rgb 
  Potentiometer controls brightness 
  cancel button clears the board, resets system 
  Various status updates along the way to inform user 
  if both the button has been pressed and the photoresister sesnses no light (nighttime), then the countdown and LED code will start


